---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Find a Clearer Path to Health Coverage" description="Independent, plain-language health coverage guidance for major life changes, starting in Florida." funnelContext="general">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Coverage guidance for real-life changes</p><h1>Find your next health coverage path.</h1><p>Understand the deadlines, compare the tradeoffs and request help from a licensed professional when you are ready.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="button" type="button" data-funnel-open data-analytics="home_hero_cta">Check My Options</button><a class="button secondary" href="/florida/">Browse Florida Guides</a></div><p class="trust-line">Independent guidance · Not a government website · No medical-history questions</p></div>
    <aside class="path-card"><p class="eyebrow">Built around the change</p><div class="path-step"><span class="path-num">01</span><div><strong>Coverage ended</strong><span>Job loss, Medicaid loss or aging off a parent’s plan.</span></div></div><div class="path-step"><span class="path-num">02</span><div><strong>Work changed</strong><span>Self-employed, 1099 or between jobs.</span></div></div><div class="path-step"><span class="path-num">03</span><div><strong>Timing changed</strong><span>Check a possible Special Enrollment Period.</span></div></div></aside>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Florida launch</p><h2>Start with the situation you are in.</h2><p class="muted">Each guide answers the immediate question first, then opens the same qualification path with the right starting prompt.</p></div><div class="grid-3">
    <a class="card link-card" href="/florida/health-insurance-after-losing-job/"><h3>Lost job coverage</h3><p>Marketplace, COBRA, spouse coverage and timing.</p><span class="link-arrow">Read the guide →</span></a>
    <a class="card link-card" href="/florida/losing-medicaid/"><h3>Losing Medicaid</h3><p>Renewal, appeal, Marketplace and KidCare paths.</p><span class="link-arrow">See next steps →</span></a>
    <a class="card link-card" href="/florida/turning-26/"><h3>Turning 26</h3><p>Coordinate the end date and replacement coverage.</p><span class="link-arrow">Compare options →</span></a>
  </div><div class="cards-cta"><div><strong>Not sure which situation applies to you?</strong><span>Start with a few questions about what changed.</span></div><button class="inline-cta" type="button" data-funnel-open data-analytics="home_cards_cta">Check My Options <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></div></section>
  <section class="section tint"><div class="container cta-panel"><div><h2>Not sure which coverage path fits your situation?</h2><p>Answer a few questions about your situation and request help reviewing available options.</p></div><button class="button" type="button" data-funnel-open data-analytics="home_bottom_cta">Check My Options</button></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
